WEBVTT

00:12:59.881 --> 00:13:03.451
Reality does not exist
until it's measured.

00:13:03.475 --> 00:13:07.274
It doesn't just take
technology to measure it.

00:13:07.298 --> 00:13:09.177
It takes our collective will.

00:13:09.201 --> 00:13:10.535
Thank you.

00:13:10.559 --> 00:13:15.603
(Applause)